# A cluster cannot grow without bound: UAX-29 never breaks before a combining
# mark, so an unbounded cell would absorb a whole stream of them. Extra marks
# past the cap are dropped rather than spilling into the next cell.
size: 8x2
chunk: 7
description: a flood of combining marks stays in one bounded cell

--- input
e\xcc\x81\xcc\x81\xcc\x81\xcc\x81\xcc\x81\xcc\x81\xcc\x81\xcc\x81\xcc\x81\xcc\x81\xcc\x81\xcc\x81X

--- expect-cell
row=0 col=1 text=X
